// MCX3 "Gripper" (`managed-in-context-design.md` MC5, MCX3) on the stand-ins: the documents
// "Gripper finger (stand-in)" (`fixtures/mic_gripper_finger_standin.cadrs`, with V1: the Finger,
// a plate 60 × 10 × 30 mm) and "Gripper (stand-in)" (`fixtures/mic_gripper_standin.cadrs`: the
// Palm, 100 × 40 × 20 mm, and the assembly Gripper with Palm <1> fixed and the Finger at V1 at
// x −50 on the Palm's top).
// 01 The Gripper: Finger <1> is linked (its version icon).
// 02 (MC5.1) Finger <1>'s menu: Edit in context: the finger's document opens (its workspace),
//    the Finger studio with the Palm as a ghost: "Context 1 of Gripper (Gripper (stand-in))".
// 03 (MC5.3) a sketch on the Palm's top face, Use on its right edge: Sketch 2's arrow.
// 04 (MC5.5) Go to assembly ▾: Go to assembly, Create version and go to assembly.
// 05 (MC5.5) Create version and go to assembly: back in the Gripper; Finger <1> now uses V2 and
//    has the solid arrow.
// 06 (MC4.4) Finger <1> moved 15 mm along X: its arrow gets the blue dot.
// 07 (MC5.8.1) Update context ▸ Context 1: the finger's document takes the snapshot and gets V3
//    ("Created by Update context in Gripper (stand-in)"); Finger <1> uses V3, the dot goes.
// 08 (MC5.1) Edit in context ▸ Context 1: the Palm's ghost and the used edge moved with the
//    update (15 mm to the left of the Finger's origin than before).
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Wait(20),
        Custom("linked-fixture store mic_gripper_finger_standin"),
        Wait(5),
        Custom("linked-fixture open mic_gripper_standin Gripper"),
        Wait(40),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(40),
        MoveTo(1300, 250),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-mcx3-gripper"),
        RightClick(ui("instance-row-2")),
        WaitFor("asm-edit-in-context"),
        Click(ui("asm-edit-in-context")),
        WaitFor("context-bar"),
        Wait(30),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(40),
        MoveTo(1300, 250),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("02-mc5-1-finger-document-in-context"),
        Click(ui("sketch")),
        WaitFor("sketch-dialog"),
        Wait(3),
        Click(xyz(85, 0, 0)),
        Wait(10),
        Key("N"),
        Wait(40),
        MoveTo(913, 520),
        Key("U"),
        Wait(2),
        ClickWorld(100, 10),
        Wait(3),
        Key("Escape"),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("sketch-dialog-accept")),
        Wait(10),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Wait(40),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(40),
        MoveTo(1300, 250),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03-mc5-3-referenced-in-the-finger-document"),
        Click(ui("context-go")),
        WaitFor("context-go-menu-version"),
        Hover(ui("context-go-menu-version")),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("04-mc5-5-go-to-assembly-menu"),
        Click(ui("context-go-menu-version")),
        Wait(40),
        MoveTo(1300, 250),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("05-mc5-5-finger-at-v2"),
        Click(xyz(-20, 0, 30)),
        Wait(10),
        Press(ui("triad-arrow-x")),
        Hover(xyz(-40, 0, 0)),
        Wait(2),
        Hover(xyz(-30, 0, 0)),
        Wait(3),
        Release,
        Wait(3),
        Type("15 mm"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Wait(10),
        Key("Escape"),
        Wait(3),
        ClickAt(1300, 250),
        Wait(240),
        MoveTo(1300, 250),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("06-mc4-4-finger-moved"),
        RightClick(ui("instance-row-2")),
        WaitFor("asm-update-context"),
        Hover(ui("asm-update-context")),
        WaitFor("asm-update-context-0"),
        Hover(ui("asm-update-context-0")),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("asm-update-context-0")),
        Wait(240),
        MoveTo(1300, 250),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("07-mc5-8-1-updated-from-the-assembly"),
        RightClick(ui("instance-row-2")),
        WaitFor("asm-edit-in-context"),
        Hover(ui("asm-edit-in-context")),
        WaitFor("asm-edit-in-context-0"),
        Click(ui("asm-edit-in-context-0")),
        WaitFor("context-bar"),
        Wait(30),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(40),
        MoveTo(1300, 250),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("08-mc5-1-the-update-in-the-finger-document"),
    ],
)
